Decide Wayland EGL on QNX with qtwayland's own EGL test, not a qtbase feature 6.8 lacks

On QNX, the wayland-egl client integration and the drm-egl server buffer
are made conditional on the qtbase feature egl_extension_platform_wayland,
which Qt 6.8's qtbase does not define (it arrived in a later qtbase):
configure stops with "Attempting to evaluate feature
egl_extension_platform_wayland but its definition is missing". What the
condition asks -- does EGL know the Wayland platform
(eglGetPlatformDisplay(EGL_PLATFORM_WAYLAND_EXT, ...)) -- is exactly
qtwayland's own compile test egl_1_5_wayland: use that on QNX. SDP 8's
EGL headers define EGL_PLATFORM_WAYLAND_EXT, and QNX's EGL on a
graphics target accepts Wayland displays (GTK 4 and wlroots use it).

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

--- a/src/configure.cmake
+++ b/src/configure.cmake
@@ -211,7 +211,7 @@
     LABEL "EGL"
     CONDITION (QT_FEATURE_wayland_client OR QT_FEATURE_wayland_server)
               AND QT_FEATURE_opengl AND QT_FEATURE_egl
-              AND (NOT QNX OR QT_FEATURE_egl_extension_platform_wayland)
+              AND (NOT QNX OR TEST_egl_1_5_wayland)
 )
 qt_feature("wayland-brcm" PRIVATE
     LABEL "Raspberry Pi"
@@ -221,7 +221,7 @@
     LABEL "DRM EGL"
     CONDITION (QT_FEATURE_wayland_client OR QT_FEATURE_wayland_server) AND QT_FEATURE_opengl
               AND QT_FEATURE_egl AND TEST_drm_egl_server
-              AND (NOT QNX OR QT_FEATURE_egl_extension_platform_wayland)
+              AND (NOT QNX OR TEST_egl_1_5_wayland)
 )
 qt_feature("wayland-libhybris-egl-server-buffer" PRIVATE
     LABEL "libhybris EGL"
